
=== Zensus 2022 results database -- authentication styles ===
    credential from ZENSUS_USER / ZENSUS_PASSWORD (user is 24 chars, password 14)
    query    -> IGNORED -- server still sees the anonymous GAST
    header   -> ACCEPTED -- server named the account (name withheld)
    basic    -> IGNORED -- server still sees the anonymous GAST
    bearer   -> IGNORED -- server still sees the anonymous GAST

=== GENESIS-Online (Destatis, federal) -- authentication styles ===
    no credential: GENESIS_USER is empty in this environment
